diff --git a/Documentation/DESKTOP_ABI.md b/Documentation/DESKTOP_ABI.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..59fa3f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/DESKTOP_ABI.md
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# Desktop ABI contract (userspace shapes IR0)
+
+> **Last verified:** 2026-09-18  
+> **Rule:** ship unmodified upstream X clients. If a client needs a Linux surface,
+> implement it in IR0 — do not patch the client to paper over kernel gaps.
+
+## Session model
+
+| Piece | Owner | Notes |
+|-------|-------|-------|
+| TinyX `Xfbdev` | ISD package (upstream) | setuid; uses `/dev/fb0` + evdev |
+| `startx` / `xinit` / `xinitrc` | ISD staging | session assembly only |
+| twm + X clients | ISD packages (upstream) | no IR0 source patches |
+| Wallpaper XBM | ISD first-party asset | fed to stock `xsetroot -bitmap` |
+
+Login remains console; user runs `startx`. No display manager yet.
+
+## Kernel surfaces required for `startx`
+
+| Surface | Why | IR0 status |
+|---------|-----|------------|
+| `/dev/fb0` + `mmap` + `FBIOGET_*` | TinyX framebuffer | verified |
+| evdev / input nodes | mouse + keyboard | verified for current smoke |
+| AF_UNIX path sockets | X11 local transport | verified |
+| SysV shm (MIT-SHM prep) | X clients | verified |
+| `/proc/loadavg` | unmodified `xload` | verified (`proc_loadavg_read`) |
+
+## Known gaps (kernel work, not client patches)
+
+- No DRI/GLX / accelerated 2D
+- No network X (TCP display)
+- No display manager / autostart-on-login (policy, not ABI)
+- DHCP / richer networking still blocked for other profiles
+
+## Versioning
+
+ISD release (`/usr/share/isd/release.txt`, `VERSION_ID` in `/etc/os-release`) is
+**independent** of the IR0 local build counter (`uname` `#N`). Inspect with
+`ir0-status version` in the guest or `make usmang` on the host.
