+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
+# Origin classification for ISD packages (name <tab> origin).
+# Unknown packages default to third-party. Origins:
+#   first-party              — written for IR0/ISD
+#   third-party              — unmodified upstream recipe
+#   third-party+isd-patches  — upstream with ISD build/runtime patches
+busybox	third-party+isd-patches
+runit	third-party
+opendoas	third-party
+nano	third-party
+ncurses	third-party
+tinycc	third-party
+gnumake	third-party
+doom	first-party
+iv	first-party
+pack-extract	first-party
